msgid "AI assistance"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Duplicate detection and spam moderation with Google Gemini. Enabled features "
"send the text of new public posts (titles, bodies, comments) to Google (the "
"Gemini API, or Vertex AI in your Google Cloud project); nothing else about "
"the author is sent."
msgstr ""

msgid "Gemini API key"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Turns on the AI features (Admin > AI assistance) through the Gemini API. Get "
"a key at <a href='https://aistudio.google.com/apikey'>Google AI Studio</a>. "
"Not needed when a Vertex AI project is set under Admin > AI assistance. If "
"empty, the server's GEMINI_API_KEY or GOOGLE_API_KEY environment variable is "
"used."
msgstr ""

msgid "Vertex AI project"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Google Cloud project ID to use Gemini through Vertex AI instead of an API "
"key. The server authenticates with Application Default Credentials (its "
"service account, or <code>gcloud auth application-default login</code>), "
"which need the Vertex AI User role. If empty, the GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT "
"environment variable is used."
msgstr ""

msgid "Vertex AI location"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Region of the Vertex AI endpoint, e.g. global, europe-west1 or us-central1."
msgstr ""

msgid "Gemini model"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The model ID used for all AI features, e.g. gemini-3.8-flash, or gemini-3.5-"
"flash-lite for lower cost."
msgstr ""

msgid "Duplicate detection"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"While someone writes a question title, point out existing questions that ask "
"the same thing."
msgstr ""

msgid "Duplicate checks per visitor per hour"
msgstr ""

msgid "Limits API use; beyond it the ask page shows the plain keyword matches."
msgstr ""

msgid "Spam and abuse moderation"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Review new and edited posts in the background. Suspected spam, abuse or off-"
"topic posts are listed for moderators under Flagged posts; they are never "
"hidden or deleted automatically."
msgstr ""

msgid "Skip moderation from reputation"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Posts by users with at least this reputation (and by staff) are not reviewed."
msgstr ""

msgid "Report from confidence"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"How sure (0 to 1) the review must be before a post is reported to moderators."
msgstr ""

msgid "Profile spam review"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When a user below the skip reputation fills in or changes their website or "
"\"about me\", check it for profile spam (SEO links, advertising). Suspect "
"accounts are listed for moderators under Flagged posts; they are never "
"suspended or deleted automatically."
msgstr ""

msgid "Embedding model"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Gemini model used to index forum threads and documentation for semantic "
"search."
msgstr ""

msgid "Documentation to crawl"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"One URL per line. The nightly index (manage.py build_knowledge_index) crawls "
"each one and the pages linked from it within the same site and path, "
"respecting robots.txt, and lets the assistant use them."
msgstr ""

msgid "Pages to crawl per URL"
msgstr ""

msgid "Upper limit of documentation pages fetched from each URL above per run."
msgstr ""

msgid "Assistant on the ask page"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Offer an AI answer before a question is posted. It is only shown when forum "
"answers or the crawled documentation clearly cover the question and a second "
"check finds every statement supported by them."
msgstr ""

msgid "Assistant answers per visitor per hour"
msgstr ""

msgid "Suggested answers on unanswered questions"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"manage.py suggest_answers (run hourly) adds a clearly marked AI suggestion, "
"with sources, to questions still unanswered after the time below, but only "
"when forum answers or the crawled documentation clearly cover the question "
"and a second check finds every statement supported by them. The asker and "
"moderators can mark it helpful or remove it. It doesn't count as an answer "
"and earns no reputation."
msgstr ""

msgid "Suggest an answer after (hours)"
msgstr ""

msgid "WordPress API key"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Your WordPress API key. You can get one at <a href='http://wordpress."
"com/'>http://wordpress.com/</a>"
msgstr ""

msgid "Minimum reputation to not have your posts checked"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The minimum reputation a user must have so that when they post a question, "
"answer or comment it is not checked for spam."
msgstr ""

